        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your relationships — with your partner and with sex — will change now that you're pregnant (and will continue to change when you're parents). But with a little creativity, you can still enjoy a healthy sex life and a solid connection — it may be even better than ever!",
